    "text": "High purity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> dihydrogen is obtained by",
